(6942029, 1046431, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love this, though it''s not perfect. The figure on the far right being cut off at frame edge hurts the flow of the image for me, and I see some sloppy selective editing around the legs of both figures. Small but prominent halos. (I''m the pot calling the kettle black here, if you go look at my "Over the top" entry, you''ll see far worse)</td>', 'Love this, though it''s not perfect. The figure on the far right being cut off at frame edge hurts the flow of the image for me, and I see some sloppy selective editing around the legs of both figures. Small but prominent halos. (I''m the pot calling the kettle black here, if you go look at my "Over the top" entry, you''ll see far worse)', '2012-12-26 12:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942030, 1046525, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I like this. Nice scene with great clouds and long dramatic shadows. Somewhat marginal on meeting the topic, since the sun in still above the horizon. Not that I haven''t stretched the topic a bit now and then. This has the feel of a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> entry.</td>', 'Ooh, I like this. Nice scene with great clouds and long dramatic shadows. Somewhat marginal on meeting the topic, since the sun in still above the horizon. Not that I haven''t stretched the topic a bit now and then. This has the feel of a  Melethia entry.', '2012-12-26 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
