(6942908, 1046254, 120570, '<td valign="top">The man looking at the camera grabs more attention than the subject (silhouette at night)</td>', 'The man looking at the camera grabs more attention than the subject (silhouette at night)', '2012-12-27 19:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942925, 1046431, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this but wish there was only one boy.  My eyes want to focus on the left side but I can see the boy on the right in my peripheral vision and find that distracting. Also, the boy on the right is missing part of his arm.</td>', 'I like this but wish there was only one boy.  My eyes want to focus on the left side but I can see the boy on the right in my peripheral vision and find that distracting. Also, the boy on the right is missing part of his arm.', '2012-12-27 19:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942956, 1046525, 135697, '<td valign="top">this looks to be a sunset and not a night time silhouette...</td>', 'this looks to be a sunset and not a night time silhouette...', '2012-12-27 20:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942996, 1046221, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very awkward comp, not sure about this one, I like the falling stars though!</td>', 'Very awkward comp, not sure about this one, I like the falling stars though!', '2012-12-27 21:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943418, 1046170, 157091, '<td valign="top">Love the light on the face of the groom.</td>', 'Love the light on the face of the groom.', '2012-12-28 11:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943419, 1046231, 157091, '<td valign="top">Great Pic</td>', 'Great Pic', '2012-12-28 11:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943593, 1046382, 155989, '<td valign="top">Technical excellence gets this an 8, but I don''t like guns and I don''t like the vigilante stance of the person. The light ray effect by the right hand is also a bit too bright and distracting so I''m afraid when I add in how I feel about the picture my score drops.</td>', 'Technical excellence gets this an 8, but I don''t like guns and I don''t like the vigilante stance of the person. The light ray effect by the right hand is also a bit too bright and distracting so I''m afraid when I add in how I feel about the picture my score drops.', '2012-12-28 17:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943596, 1046456, 155989, '<td valign="top">Seasonal jollity is appropriate. Little things distract for me like the weird things above the head of the figure on the extreme right. I would honestly have actually cropped that figure out entirely as for me the focus of the picture should be the light area behind the glasses, after all it is the raising of the glasses in a toast that is the central theme of this picture and therefore should have been more central in the image. Cropping would also have helped with the slight lighting imbalance in the picture as it is with the right side being much lighter than the left which also draws your eye away from the action with the glasses off over to the right. <br/> <br/>I think I would also have taken a moment to ask people to move slightly so as to remove the overlap between the three figures immediately to the left of the very tall man with the sharp nose. As it is it looks like one person with 3 right arms and a very odd head. <br/> <br/>The lighting however in the central area and the darkness of the silhouettes is spot on.</td>', 'Seasonal jollity is appropriate. Little things distract for me like the weird things above the head of the figure on the extreme right. I would honestly have actually cropped that figure out entirely as for me the focus of the picture should be the light area behind the glasses, after all it is the raising of the glasses in a toast that is the central theme of this picture and therefore should have been more central in the image. Cropping would also have helped with the slight lighting imbalance in the picture as it is with the right side being much lighter than the left which also draws your eye away from the action with the glasses off over to the right.  I think I would also have taken a moment to ask people to move slightly so as to remove the overlap between the three figures immediately to the left of the very tall man with the sharp nose. As it is it looks like one person with 3 right arms and a very odd head.  The lighting however in the central area and the darkness of the silhouettes is spot on.', '2012-12-28 17:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943597, 1046170, 155989, '<td valign="top">excellent use of light and dark in this photo but I''m not sure appropriate for a wedding. It makes it feel a bit too cold and ''gothic''. One almost expects some Bronte-esque tragedy to overtake them at any moment. Unless of course that is what you were hoping to achieve....</td>', 'excellent use of light and dark in this photo but I''m not sure appropriate for a wedding. It makes it feel a bit too cold and ''gothic''. One almost expects some Bronte-esque tragedy to overtake them at any moment. Unless of course that is what you were hoping to achieve....', '2012-12-28 17:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943599, 1046221, 155989, '<td valign="top">I quite like this one. Starfall pics tend to be somewhat a bit of a muchness .. the cactus adds interest.</td>', 'I quite like this one. Starfall pics tend to be somewhat a bit of a muchness .. the cactus adds interest.', '2012-12-28 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943601, 1046428, 155989, '<td valign="top">Slightly clichéd right down to the slightly misshapen heart between them, but well done for all that syrupy sweetness.</td>', 'Slightly clichéd right down to the slightly misshapen heart between them, but well done for all that syrupy sweetness.', '2012-12-28 17:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943602, 1046522, 155989, '<td valign="top">Beautiful old fashioned feel to this silhouette - the kind of silhouette you expect to see carved into a locket ... except for the odd sparkle in her neck.</td>', 'Beautiful old fashioned feel to this silhouette - the kind of silhouette you expect to see carved into a locket ... except for the odd sparkle in her neck.', '2012-12-28 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943603, 1046490, 155989, '<td valign="top">a pity the figures didn''t stand out against the lights a little more.</td>', 'a pity the figures didn''t stand out against the lights a little more.', '2012-12-28 17:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943604, 1046527, 155989, '<td valign="top">Brilliant title and image. Well done.</td>', 'Brilliant title and image. Well done.', '2012-12-28 17:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943605, 1046505, 155989, '<td valign="top">Suitably moody.</td>', 'Suitably moody.', '2012-12-28 17:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943607, 1046525, 155989, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t they be facing the other way if they were greeting the night? Lovely silhouettes and the clouds are gorgeously sharp.</td>', 'Wouldn''t they be facing the other way if they were greeting the night? Lovely silhouettes and the clouds are gorgeously sharp.', '2012-12-28 17:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943610, 1046474, 155989, '<td valign="top">The time has come to talk of many things ... (even if that is the Mad Hatter and not the Carpenter) ... but the man on the bicycle is a bit like the proverbial fish. I love the silhouette of the Mad Hatter though.</td>', 'The time has come to talk of many things ... (even if that is the Mad Hatter and not the Carpenter) ... but the man on the bicycle is a bit like the proverbial fish. I love the silhouette of the Mad Hatter though.', '2012-12-28 17:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943611, 1046461, 155989, '<td valign="top">I feel like howling at the moon ... woooo-oooo-oooo</td>', 'I feel like howling at the moon ... woooo-oooo-oooo', '2012-12-28 17:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943614, 1046448, 155989, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept but I''m not sure the execution was 100%. The "walker" isn''t actually walking and the brolly doesn''t fit the sunset ... no rain ... love the night cityscape. Would like to see this one done with an actual walking figure striding over the landscape which is the image your title and most of your picture suggests to me.</td>', 'Interesting concept but I''m not sure the execution was 100%. The "walker" isn''t actually walking and the brolly doesn''t fit the sunset ... no rain ... love the night cityscape. Would like to see this one done with an actual walking figure striding over the landscape which is the image your title and most of your picture suggests to me.', '2012-12-28 17:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943615, 1046466, 155989, '<td valign="top">Shhhhh!</td>', 'Shhhhh!', '2012-12-28 17:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
