(6946746, 1046345, 109363, '<td valign="top">i would have cropped this a bit more on the left side (or decreased brighness) to get rid of the bright secondary vertical element... it draws attention away from the main subject and lessens the "blackness" of the night the little girl is going into.  the white oval in the lower center could also have been cloned out, IMO</td>', 'i would have cropped this a bit more on the left side (or decreased brighness) to get rid of the bright secondary vertical element... it draws attention away from the main subject and lessens the "blackness" of the night the little girl is going into.  the white oval in the lower center could also have been cloned out, IMO', '2013-01-01 20:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946748, 1046522, 109363, '<td valign="top">if that is a (pearl) earing glimmering, would have been nice to see it a bit more clearly... kinda like all those Zales "Diamonds are Forever" commercials with shadow people and jewelry</td>', 'if that is a (pearl) earing glimmering, would have been nice to see it a bit more clearly... kinda like all those Zales "Diamonds are Forever" commercials with shadow people and jewelry', '2013-01-01 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
