(6946928, 1046382, 19825, '<td valign="top">An ominous mood to this. Congrats on an excellent image and ribbon.<br/> <br/>ETA: I just noticed participants score this image below 6. That seems completely crazy to me. I am not a huge fan of guns, but come on. This is a fantastic shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-01-02 16:26:24.</i></td>', 'An ominous mood to this. Congrats on an excellent image and ribbon. ETA: I just noticed participants score this image below 6. That seems completely crazy to me. I am not a huge fan of guns, but come on. This is a fantastic shot.', '2013-01-02 00:11:02.000000', '2013-01-02 16:26:24.000000', 0),
