(6946931, 1046456, 135697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bsluijk:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the idea behind the shot, the way the glasses are captured and the silhouettes that together tell a story. With a little more attention to composition (the arm across a face, the missing profile of h female in the middle, the cut off nose of the all gentlemen, a little tighter crop perhaps) this could have been a winner. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks and i do appreciate the feedback :O)<br/> <br/>I explored both at the time of shooting and in post processing those things you and others have mentioned here as well as other things and i discounted them purposely, for my own artistic point of view i much prefer it the way i have finished and shot it :O) but yes i couldve done those things and maybe it would have ribboned ;O)</td>', 'Originally posted by bsluijk: I like the idea behind the shot, the way the glasses are captured and the silhouettes that together tell a story. With a little more attention to composition (the arm across a face, the missing profile of h female in the middle, the cut off nose of the all gentlemen, a little tighter crop perhaps) this could have been a winner.   Thanks and i do appreciate the feedback :O) I explored both at the time of shooting and in post processing those things you and others have mentioned here as well as other things and i discounted them purposely, for my own artistic point of view i much prefer it the way i have finished and shot it :O) but yes i couldve done those things and maybe it would have ribboned ;O)', '2013-01-02 00:11:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6946936, 1046487, 101707, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks at 8. Gorgeous image that deserved better.</td>', 'One of my top picks at 8. Gorgeous image that deserved better.', '2013-01-02 00:14:29.000000', NULL, 0),
