(6946995, 1046431, 135697, '<td valign="top">very nice image, congrats on 6th. personally speaking it should have been higher especially seeing the last image was not a night time silhoutte. Composition is great regardless of partially missing a limb, makes no difference to the image at all imho, great!</td>', 'very nice image, congrats on 6th. personally speaking it should have been higher especially seeing the last image was not a night time silhoutte. Composition is great regardless of partially missing a limb, makes no difference to the image at all imho, great!', '2013-01-02 00:45:09.000000', NULL, 0),
