(6947190, 1046382, 103032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Good guy, bad guy, guns, no guns... doesn''t take away from it being a great image. Congrats on the ribbon. Love the smoke in the bg. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>+++ What tanguera said. Great image. Congrats on the red.<br/> <br/>To add, this is a success on many fronts. You won a ribbon, you invoked strong opinions.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Good guy, bad guy, guns, no guns... doesn''t take away from it being a great image. Congrats on the ribbon. Love the smoke in the bg.   +++ What tanguera said. Great image. Congrats on the red. To add, this is a success on many fronts. You won a ribbon, you invoked strong opinions.', '2013-01-02 06:01:17.000000', NULL, 0),
