(6947300, 1046448, 136989, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I think you got a double whammy ... the light from the city looks very sunset-like.  In a challenge that called for night the voters were all over this. Second is shadow versus silhouette.  If the guy had been walking along a fence with the city as a background so that you could see him walking you might have scored higher.</td>', 'Unfortunately I think you got a double whammy ... the light from the city looks very sunset-like.  In a challenge that called for night the voters were all over this. Second is shadow versus silhouette.  If the guy had been walking along a fence with the city as a background so that you could see him walking you might have scored higher.', '2013-01-02 09:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
