(6947494, 1046382, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t like snakes.  I wish they did not exist.  But, when I see a photo of one, I vote on the image quality.   I don''t think every snake image has an underlying message or do I think the person who photographed the snake is evil.<br/> <br/>I really, really hate snakes, though.  :D<br/> <br/>This is a fabulously done image.   The technicals are wonderfully satisfied.</td>', 'I don''t like snakes.  I wish they did not exist.  But, when I see a photo of one, I vote on the image quality.   I don''t think every snake image has an underlying message or do I think the person who photographed the snake is evil. I really, really hate snakes, though.  :D This is a fabulously done image.   The technicals are wonderfully satisfied.', '2013-01-02 14:46:30.000000', NULL, 0),
