(6955459, 1046382, 153152, '<td valign="top">I am pretty knew here and haven''t interacted much. When I saw this shot I had to click on it to appreciate it better. <br/> <br/>I then read the varying comments about the subject and quite confused at what I perceive a sad imbalance in what we respond too.<br/> <br/>I believe millions of people are severely hurt by pornography. If someone submitted an "artistic" photo with someone holding a porn magazine, instead of a gun, would there be any reaction at all? I wonder??? People hurt People, with whatever is at hand.<br/> <br/>I grew up with guns on the farm. They are a tool, as other things are. I believe these video games that many of these young adults have played for years do more to promote violence, and need to be severely regulated, not guns.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-01-11 21:38:25.</i></td>', 'I am pretty knew here and haven''t interacted much. When I saw this shot I had to click on it to appreciate it better.  I then read the varying comments about the subject and quite confused at what I perceive a sad imbalance in what we respond too. I believe millions of people are severely hurt by pornography. If someone submitted an "artistic" photo with someone holding a porn magazine, instead of a gun, would there be any reaction at all? I wonder??? People hurt People, with whatever is at hand. I grew up with guns on the farm. They are a tool, as other things are. I believe these video games that many of these young adults have played for years do more to promote violence, and need to be severely regulated, not guns.', '2013-01-11 21:29:40.000000', '2013-01-11 21:38:25.000000', 0),
(6958127, 1046521, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting the way the foreground bokeh seems to have tempered the exposure of the moon. My moons too quickly turn to mishapen white ellipses.</td>', 'Interesting the way the foreground bokeh seems to have tempered the exposure of the moon. My moons too quickly turn to mishapen white ellipses.', '2013-01-15 16:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
